# Lock screen: our wallpaper (light/dark variant follows the colour scheme), clock and media controls.
[Greeter]
WallpaperPlugin=org.kde.image

[Greeter][Wallpaper][org.kde.image][General]
Image=/usr/share/wallpapers/Kristall/
PreviewImage=/usr/share/wallpapers/Kristall/

[Greeter][LnF][General]
alwaysShowClock=true
showMediaControls=true
